+## Phase 3: User Story 8 — Circuito de Evaluación y Conformidad (Priority: P1) 🎯 MVP
+
+**Goal**: El responsable crea evaluaciones y el empleado da conformidad, formalizando la evaluación de forma inmutable con la fecha del servidor.
+
+**Independent Test**: Ejecutar `PerformanceReviewIntegrationTest` verificando el circuito completo (creación → conformidad → `FINALIZED`) y que un intento de modificar una evaluación `FINALIZED` retorna `409`.
+
+### Backend Implementation
+
+- [x] T009 [US8] Create `PerformanceReviewService` interface and `PerformanceReviewServiceImpl` (`@Service @Transactional`) implementing: `getMyReviews()` (authenticated employee's own reviews), `getTeamReviews()` (manager's current team reviews), `getTeamEmployees()` (active team members sorted by last/first name), `createReview(employeeId, request)` (validates team membership and active status), `acknowledge(reviewId, request)` (pessimistic lock, checks ownership, calls `review.acknowledge(comments, Instant.now(clock))`) in `backend/src/main/java/com/iw/rrhh/performance/service/PerformanceReviewServiceImpl.java`
+- [x] T010 [US8] Create `PerformanceReviewController` with per-method `@PreAuthorize`: `GET /performance-reviews/me` (`EMPLEADO`), `GET /performance-reviews/team` (`RESPONSABLE_EQUIPO`), `GET /performance-reviews/team/employees` (`RESPONSABLE_EQUIPO`), `POST /performance-reviews/team/{employeeId}` (`RESPONSABLE_EQUIPO`), `POST /performance-reviews/{reviewId}/acknowledge` (`EMPLEADO`) in `backend/src/main/java/com/iw/rrhh/performance/controller/PerformanceReviewController.java`
+- [x] T011 [US8] Create `PerformanceReviewIntegrationTest` (Testcontainers + MockMvc, `Clock` fixed) covering: manager creates review → born `PENDING_ACKNOWLEDGMENT`; employee acknowledges → `FINALIZED` with server-side `finalizedAt`; second acknowledge returns `409`; direct DB UPDATE on `FINALIZED` raises PostgreSQL trigger exception; employee cannot see another employee's reviews; manager cannot create review for employee of another team; `rating=0` and `rating=6` return `400`; `RRHH` role returns `403` on creation endpoint in `backend/src/test/java/com/iw/rrhh/performance/PerformanceReviewIntegrationTest.java`
+
+### Frontend Implementation
+
+- [x] T012 [P] [US8] Create `PerformanceReviewService` with `getMyReviews()`, `getTeamReviews()`, `getTeamEmployees()`, `createReview(employeeId, request)`, `acknowledge(reviewId, request)` calling the corresponding API endpoints in `frontend/src/app/features/performance/services/performance-review.service.ts`
+- [x] T013 [US8] Create `PerformanceReviewsComponent` with two views controlled by role: **RESPONSABLE_EQUIPO view** — employee selector from `/team/employees`, form with period, objectives, rating (1–5 slider), manager comments, submit button (creates review); team reviews list with period, employee name, rating stars, status badge; **EMPLEADO view** — own reviews list; detail panel showing all fields, employee comments textarea, "Dar conformidad y formalizar" button (disabled if `FINALIZED`); finalized reviews are read-only with `finalizedAt` date in `frontend/src/app/features/performance/components/performance-reviews/performance-reviews.component.ts`
+- [x] T014 [P] [US8] Register lazy route `/performance` with `authGuard` in `frontend/src/app/app.routes.ts` and add nav link "Evaluaciones" shown for `RESPONSABLE_EQUIPO` and `EMPLEADO` roles in `frontend/src/app/app.html`
